  "decisions": [
    "Four visible columns only: fish, where to catch, minimum, no-fail. Cooking and stat bonuses deferred.",
    "Classic thresholds retained as references, not measured Forever guarantees. Unlike a simplified chance-only derivation, the inspected Classic success code also checks skill >= zone base; the 55/130/205/330 bands are retained.",
    "The Classic cast code contains additional hard-coded location gates which conflict with other references (including Stormwind and Wailing Caverns); no claim is made that that emulator code reproduces the Forever server.",
    "Raw Sagefish uses corroborated Ashenvale/Hillsbrad school locations instead of the unsupported Wetlands example. Greater Sagefish uses the school groups named for Alterac and Stranglethorn.",
    "Stormwind is retained for Longjaw Mud Snapper; an uncorroborated Loch Modan example is omitted.",
    "Feralas locations are explicitly coastal where the reference tables identify The Forgotten Coast. Generic Feralas is omitted for Redgill/Nightfin/Sunscale because water/subzone requirements differ.",
    "Whimsyfin item 251524 and its pool area are supported by the Forever guide; ~150 no-fail remains an approximate player report.",
    "The two Riverglades rows retain unverified catch locations and null skill values, with no inferred thresholds.",
    "Season/time labels are retained as Classic reference qualifiers, with night/day described as favored windows."
  ]
